---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Custom tombstone design" description="Work with TIRO to create a personal memorial.">
  <section class="custom-hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><a class="back-link" href="/tombstones/">← Back to catalogue</a><p class="eyebrow">Custom memorials</p><h1>A memorial as individual as their story.</h1><p class="hero-copy">Start with a feeling, a photograph or a simple idea. TIRO will guide the design conversation and confirm the final materials, price and installation details with you.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="#design-request">Start your design request <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><p class="hero-note">No payment is taken online. Your request goes directly to TIRO for a personal follow-up.</p></div><div class="hero-gallery" aria-label="Examples from the TIRO memorial range"><figure class="gallery-main"><img src="/images/tombstones/marble-shrine.webp" alt="Marble shrine memorial from the TIRO catalogue" /><figcaption>Personalise the details that matter.</figcaption></figure><figure class="gallery-small gallery-top"><img src="/images/tombstones/statai.webp" alt="Customised Statai tombstone from the TIRO catalogue" /></figure><figure class="gallery-small gallery-bottom"><img src="/images/tombstones/faku-full.webp" alt="Faku Full tombstone from the TIRO catalogue" /></figure></div></div></section>

  <section class="section design-intro"><div class="container"><div class="section-lead"><p class="eyebrow">Designed with care</p><h2 class="heading">A clear, thoughtful way to begin.</h2><p>You do not need a finished design. Choose what feels right, share the practical details you know, and TIRO will help shape the next conversation.</p></div><div class="process-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Share your idea</h3><p>Tell us about the person, the style you have in mind and an approximate budget.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Review the options</h3><p>TIRO reviews your request and discusses suitable materials, personalisation and installation needs.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Confirm together</h3><p>You receive confirmed design, pricing and next-step information before any commitment is made.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="section inspiration"><div class="container"><div class="inspiration-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Find your direction</p><h2 class="heading">Begin with the feeling you want to honour.</h2><p>Select a direction below to add it to your request. It is simply a starting point—TIRO will help refine the details.</p></div><div class="style-grid" role="group" aria-label="Design style"><button type="button" class="style-choice" data-style="Classic and timeless"><span class="style-number">01</span><strong>Classic &amp; timeless</strong><small>Balanced form, enduring materials and traditional detail.</small></button><button type="button" class="style-choice" data-style="Modern and sculptural"><span class="style-number">02</span><strong>Modern &amp; sculptural</strong><small>Clean lines, strong profiles and a contemporary finish.</small></button><button type="button" class="style-choice" data-style="Family tribute"><span class="style-number">03</span><strong>Family tribute</strong><small>Space to honour a shared history and more than one name.</small></button><button type="button" class="style-choice" data-style="Faith and symbolism"><span class="style-number">04</span><strong>Faith &amp; symbolism</strong><small>Meaningful motifs, inscriptions and personal symbols.</small></button></div></div></section>

  <section class="custom-page section" id="design-request"><div class="container custom-shell"><div class="request-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your design request</p><h2 class="heading">Tell TIRO what you are imagining.</h2><p>Fields marked required help the team respond with the right next step.</p></div><form id="custom-form" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="hidden" name="style" id="selected-style" value="" /><div class="custom-grid"><section><p class="eyebrow">Your vision</p><h3>Shape the memorial.</h3><label>Inspiration image <span class="optional">Optional</span><input type="file" name="inspiration" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" /><small>JPG, PNG or WebP, up to 5 MB. The image is attached to your request and not stored by this site.</small></label><label>Tell us about the memorial<textarea name="description" rows="5" required placeholder="Share a style, inscription, motif or memory you would like to discuss."></textarea></label><div class="fields"><label>Preferred material<select name="material"><option value="">No preference yet</option><option>Granite</option><option>Marble</option><option>Granite and marble</option><option>I'd like TIRO's advice</option></select></label><label>Approximate budget<select name="budget" required><option value="">Choose a range</option><option>Up to R15,000</option><option>R15,000 – R30,000</option><option>R30,000 – R50,000</option><option>Above R50,000</option><option>I'd like to discuss this</option></select></label></div><p class="selected-style" id="style-message" hidden></p></section><section><p class="eyebrow">Location and contact</p><h3>Help us prepare.</h3><div class="fields"><label>Province<select name="province" required><option value="">Choose province</option><option>Eastern Cape</option><option>Free State</option><option>Gauteng</option><option>KwaZulu-Natal</option><option>Limpopo</option><option>Mpumalanga</option><option>North West</option><option>Northern Cape</option><option>Western Cape</option></select></label><label>Town<input name="town" required /></label></div><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label><div class="fields"><label>Mobile number<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required /></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label></div><aside class="form-assurance"><strong>What happens next</strong><span>TIRO will review the request and contact you to discuss the appropriate options. Final pricing and installation requirements are confirmed directly with you.</span></aside></section></div><p class="form-error" id="custom-error" role="alert" hidden>Please complete the required details.</p><button class="button button-primary" type="submit" id="custom-submit">Send design request <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></button><p class="privacy-note">Your request and optional image are sent securely to TIRO. This website does not permanently store them.</p><section class="complete" id="custom-complete" hidden aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">Request received</p><h3>Thank you for sharing your idea.</h3><p id="custom-message">TIRO will review your request.</p><a class="button button-secondary" href="/tombstones/">Back to catalogue</a></section></form></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<script>
  const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#custom-form');
  const error = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#custom-error');
  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#custom-submit');
  const complete = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#custom-complete');
  const message = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#custom-message');
  const styleField = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#selected-style');
  const styleMessage = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#style-message');
  const styleChoices = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.style-choice'));

  styleChoices.forEach((choice) => choice.addEventListener('click', () => {
    styleChoices.forEach((item) => { item.classList.toggle('selected', item === choice); item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(item === choice)); });
    if (styleField) styleField.value = choice.dataset.style ?? '';
    if (styleMessage) { styleMessage.hidden = false; styleMessage.textContent = `Selected direction: ${choice.dataset.style ?? ''}`; }
  }));

  if (form && error && button && complete && message) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!form.checkValidity()) { error.hidden = false; form.reportValidity(); return; }
      const file = (form.elements.namedItem('inspiration') as HTMLInputElement | null)?.files?.[0];
      if (file && (!['image/jpeg', 'image/png', 'image/webp'].includes(file.type) || file.size > 5 * 1024 * 1024)) { error.textContent = 'Upload a JPG, PNG, or WebP image up to 5 MB.'; error.hidden = false; return; }
      error.hidden = true; button.disabled = true; button.textContent = 'Sending securely…';
      try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/tombstones/custom', { method: 'POST', body: new FormData(form) });
        const result = await response.json();
        if (result.status === 'failed') throw new Error(result.messages?.[0] ?? 'We could not send your request.');
        complete.hidden = false; message.textContent = result.messages?.[0] ?? 'TIRO will review your request.'; button.hidden = true;
      } catch (reason) { error.textContent = reason instanceof Error ? reason.message : 'We could not send your request.'; error.hidden = false; button.disabled = false; button.innerHTML = 'Send design request <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>'; }
    });
  }
</script>
<style>
  .custom-hero { overflow:hidden; padding:clamp(54px,8vw,104px) 0; background:var(--tiro-navy); color:#fff; }.hero-grid{display:grid;gap:44px;align-items:center}.back-link{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:46px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;text-underline-offset:5px}.custom-hero .eyebrow{color:#dbe8ff}.custom-hero h1{max-width:680px;margin:10px 0 18px;font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.1rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.065em}.hero-copy{max-width:610px;font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.22rem)}.hero-note{margin:16px 0 0;color:#dbe8ff;font-size:.8rem}.hero-gallery{position:relative;min-height:420px}.hero-gallery figure{margin:0;overflow:hidden;border:5px solid #fff;background:#dbe2eb;box-shadow:0 22px 54px #0007}.gallery-main{position:absolute;inset:0 50px 0 0;border-radius:28px}.gallery-main img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.gallery-main figcaption{position:absolute;left:16px;bottom:16px;max-width:200px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:8px;background:#071a3de0;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700}.gallery-small{position:absolute;width:39%;aspect-ratio:1;right:0;border-radius:18px}.gallery-small img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.gallery-top{top:24px}.gallery-bottom{bottom:24px}.design-intro{background:#fff}.section-lead{max-width:680px}.section-lead p:not(.eyebrow),.inspiration-copy p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:1.05rem}.process-grid,.style-grid{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:32px}.process-grid article{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--tiro-light-grey);border-radius:18px}.process-grid span,.style-number{color:var(--tiro-red);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em}.process-grid h3{margin:8px 0;color:var(--tiro-navy);font-size:1.2rem}.process-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--tiro-grey);font-size:.9rem}.inspiration{background:var(--tiro-soft-white)}.inspiration-copy{max-width:700px}.style-choice{display:grid;gap:8px;min-height:174px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--tiro-light-grey);border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:var(--tiro-navy);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 180ms,border-color 180ms,box-shadow 180ms}.style-choice:hover,.style-choice.selected{border-color:var(--tiro-blue);box-shadow:0 12px 30px #032e7614;transform:translateY(-2px)}.style-choice strong{font-size:1.1rem}.style-choice small{color:var(--tiro-grey);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.45}.custom-page{background:#fff}.custom-shell{max-width:1100px}.request-heading{max-width:700px}.request-heading p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--tiro-grey)}.custom-page form{margin-top:34px;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,38px);border:1px solid var(--tiro-light-grey);border-radius:24px;background:var(--tiro-soft-white)}.custom-grid{display:grid;gap:42px}.custom-page h3{margin:8px 0 20px;color:var(--tiro-navy);font-size:1.65rem}.custom-page label{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:14px;color:var(--tiro-navy);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800}.custom-page input,.custom-page select,.custom-page textarea{width:100%;min-height:52px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #b7c2d1;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.custom-page input[type=file]{padding:10px}.custom-page textarea{min-height:132px;resize:vertical}.custom-page small,.optional{color:var(--tiro-grey);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:500}.fields{display:grid;gap:14px}.form-assurance{display:grid;gap:5px;margin-top:22px;padding:15px;border-radius:14px;background:#edf3fb;color:var(--tiro-navy);font-size:.85rem}.form-assurance span{color:#40516e}.selected-style{margin:16px 0 0;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:8px;background:#edf3fb;color:var(--tiro-blue);font-size:.84rem;font-weight:800}.form-error{margin:24px 0 0;color:#a31220;font-weight:800}.custom-page form>.button{margin-top:18px}.privacy-note{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--tiro-grey);font-size:.8rem}.complete{margin-top:28px;padding:22px;border-radius:16px;background:#edf3fb}.complete h3{margin:8px 0}.complete p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--tiro-grey)}@media(min-width:680px){.process-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.style-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(min-width:850px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr}.custom-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.style-choice:hover,.style-choice.selected{transform:none}}
</style>
